\subsection*{Implementation Pathways}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=1.2em]
&nbsp;&nbsp;\item \textbf{Numerical solvers:} eigenvalue analysis of <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> for stability \citep{bird1988}.
